{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:46 2026-10-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:46 2026-10-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:46 2026-10-16 HKT</p><img alt=\"方嘉柏（右）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/e943a164851957e47d735e9cd0744ff3/2026-10/179212939556889.jpg\"/><p>早前不少練馬師往澳洲出席拍賣會，令沙田晨課場面比較冷清；不過，今早晨課卻十分熱鬧，皆因為多位練者已完成揀蟀任務，由澳洲返回香港緊守崗位，包括丁冠豪、姚本輝、方嘉柏、黎昭昇、徐雨石、游達榮及巫偉傑等都已返港，並穿梭烽火台及機坪之間睇馬，十分勤力。</p><img alt=\"丁冠豪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fb2333c82de6d635aed4f78168fa0afe/2026-10/179212947873976.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"巫偉傑\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/23d220c645674315099960368abb37a0/2026-10/179212947973381.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"姚本輝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3490cb0170f277d66a48d47b5357b33d/2026-10/179212947948350.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"徐雨石\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7d9534c08c53e46a9ab70aedb84d07e4/2026-10/179212947981123.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"黎昭昇\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/11b3dd59e191e0f4fd933318d8d9a82e/2026-10/179212947926719.jpg\"/><p>陳嘉甜</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T05:59:24.150560+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:46:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T09:58:05.915394+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T05:57:41.823730+00:00","content_hash":"101d41c880290cc4175542b90f7a40ca3bb0b7cbb44792605ab2a955419d5c2c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}